WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue {
    color: white;
    background-color: #383943A3;
}

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.643
This path got somewhere useful.

00:00:02.643 --> 00:00:07.577
Maya admitted the real reason she wanted to go out –
not because she thought it would be fine, but because

00:00:07.577 --> 00:00:13.057
sitting with pre-first-day nerves is uncomfortable
and Priya and Sam are a good distraction.

00:00:13.057 --> 00:00:14.148
Most people have been there.

00:00:14.148 --> 00:00:16.482
The question is what actually helps more.

00:00:17.682 --> 00:00:22.430
Going out postpones the nerves until the morning,
when there's no time to do anything about them.

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:27.168
What actually helps is getting organized – knowing
where she's going, what to bring, what orientation

00:00:27.168 --> 00:00:27.852
involves.

00:00:29.052 --> 00:00:30.979
That's what the information pack is for.

00:00:30.979 --> 00:00:34.335
Companies send those out so you're not walking in
cold on day one.

00:00:34.335 --> 00:00:36.168
Maya hasn't opened hers yet.

00:00:36.168 --> 00:00:41.312
That's probably a better use of the evening than convincing
herself two hours means two hours.